{"lang":"es","dir":"ltr","title":"La Piñata Taqueria | Lonchera de tacos y burritos en Vallejo, CA","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Ir al contenido</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">LP</span><span>La Piñata Taqueria</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">Nosotros</a><a href=\"menu/\">Menú</a><a href=\"#faq\">Preguntas</a><a href=\"#gallery\">Fotos</a><a href=\"#reviews\">Reseñas</a><a href=\"#visit\">Horario y ubicación</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"Idioma\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\" selected>Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\">Pedir</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/hero-tacos.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Lonchera de tacos · 809 Broadway · Vallejo</p>\n    <h1>La Piñata Taqueria</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">La lonchera amarilla de Broadway que entró en la lista de los mejores burritos del Área de la Bahía del San Francisco Chronicle. Suadero crujiente, dos salsas buenísimas y súper burritos bien grandes.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.7 · 276 reseñas en Google<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> Llama para pedir por adelantado</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%2C%20809%20Broadway%2C%20Vallejo%2C%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> Cómo llegar</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>#6 en el Top 100 de loncheras de Yelp en EE. UU. (2025)</li><li>En la lista de mejores burritos del SF Chronicle</li><li>Para llevar, pedidos por teléfono y catering</li><li>Mesas de picnic al aire libre</li><li>Abierto lunes a viernes de 11 a 9</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">La lonchera</p><h2>Ingredientes frescos. Mucho sabor. Precios justos.</h2><p>La Piñata es una lonchera amarilla estacionada en 809 Broadway que sirve auténtica comida mexicana hecha con ingredientes frescos y de calidad: tacos, tortas, quesadillas, nachos, súper burritos y platillos de camarón, además de horchata y agua de jamaica.</p><p>En 2025, Yelp nos colocó en el #6 de su lista histórica del Top 100 de loncheras en EE. UU., y el San Francisco Chronicle nos incluyó en su lista de los mejores burritos del Área de la Bahía en noviembre de 2022. Algunos de nuestros clientes vienen manejando desde San Francisco.</p><div class=\"facts\"><div class=\"fact\"><b>#6</b><span>Top 100 de loncheras de Yelp</span></div><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.7★</b><span>276 reseñas</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>Lun–Vie</b><span>11 AM–9 PM</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/tacos.jpg\" alt=\"Plato de tacos callejeros de La Piñata\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"menu\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Menú</p><h2>Lo que hay en el menú</h2><p>Tacos, súper burritos, tortas, nachos y quesadillas.</p></div><div class=\"menu-cards\"><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-tacos\"><img src=\"images/tacos-plate.jpg\" alt=\"Plato de tacos de La Piñata con cilantro, cebolla, rábano y zanahorias\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h3>Tacos</h3><ul><li><span>Taco</span><b>$3.50</b></li></ul></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-burritos\"><img src=\"images/burrito-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Súper burrito de La Piñata abierto sobre papel aluminio\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h3>Burritos</h3><ul><li><span>Super Burrito</span><b>$16</b></li><li><span>Súper burrito vegetariano</span><b>$14</b></li><li><span>Súper burrito de camarón</span><b>$18</b></li></ul><span class=\"more\">+1 más</span></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-tortas-nachos-quesadillas\"><img src=\"images/chips-salsas-pickled-veggies.jpg\" alt=\"Totopos, salsa roja y verde, zanahorias en escabeche y un jalapeño asado de La Piñata\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h3>Tortas, nachos y quesadillas</h3><ul><li><span>Torta</span><b>$16</b></li><li><span>Super Nachos</span><b>$16</b></li><li><span>Super Quesadilla</span><b>$16</b></li></ul></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-drinks\"><div><h3>Bebidas</h3><ul><li><span>Refresco de lata</span><b>$2</b></li><li><span>Refresco mexicano</span><b>$3</b></li><li><span>Agua</span><b>$1</b></li></ul><span class=\"more\">+1 más</span></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-extras\"><div><h3>Extras</h3><ul><li><span>Queso, crema o aguacate en tacos</span><b>$0.25</b></li><li><span>Queso, crema o aguacate en burritos</span><b>$1</b></li></ul></div></a></div><div class=\"cta-row menu-cta\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"menu/\">Ver el menú completo y precios →</a></div><div class=\"menu-source\"><p>Los precios pueden cambiar.</p></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Bueno saber</p><h2>Antes de venir</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>Para llevar</b><span>La comida va bien envuelta para llevar</span></li><li><b>Pedidos por teléfono</b><span>Llama antes y evita la fila</span></li><li><b>Catering</b><span>Llama a la lonchera para preguntar</span></li><li><b>Efectivo o tarjeta</b><span>Puede aplicarse un pequeño cargo al pagar con tarjeta</span></li><li><b>Estacionamiento en la calle</b></li><li><b>Mesas al aire libre</b><span>Mesas de picnic</span></li><li><b>Más concurrido los viernes a eso de las 6 PM</b><span>La espera puede ser de hasta unos 15 min</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Galería</p><h2>Recién salido de la lonchera</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/tacos-plate.jpg\" alt=\"Plato de tacos con cilantro, cebolla, rábano, zanahorias y limón\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Tacos</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-plate.jpg\" alt=\"Súper burrito en un plato con zanahorias en escabeche y un vaso de horchata\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Súper burrito</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/chips-salsas-pickled-veggies.jpg\" alt=\"Totopos, salsa roja y verde, zanahorias en escabeche y un jalapeño asado\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Totopos, salsas y verduras en escabeche</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Burrito abierto sobre papel aluminio\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Burrito</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-closeup.jpg\" alt=\"Primer plano de un burrito relleno de carne, arroz y queso\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Burrito</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-foil.jpg\" alt=\"Burrito envuelto en aluminio, ya mordido\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Burrito para llevar</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">En las noticias</p><h2>Reconocimientos</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“Our latest obsession is this taco truck. Service is always awesome, employees are always pleasant, and service is fast. Today they packed our food [chicken tacos and super carne asada burritos] with everything extra: plenty of red and green salsa, chips and extra grilled onion/jalapeno. Everything was delicious.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Yelp Top 100 Food Trucks in the US 2025 (#6)</b> · Yelp Elite Carla G. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/article/top-100-food-trucks-2025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“A Suadero Super Burrito from La Piñata might be one of the best things to eat in Vallejo — it’s in the top five at least.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>San Francisco Chronicle</b> · Top Burritos in the Bay Area, Nov 2022</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Reseñas</p><h2>Vale la pena el viaje</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.7</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 276 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Google →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 438 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Yelp →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“suadero super burrito 10/10 would recommend. best burrito i’ve had in a minute! my sister got a al pastor taco which was a also very good. solid salsa (red one is sooo good) and food comes with pickles veggies which i love. also jamaica and horchata are both great. the horchata has a little coconut flavor. we live in the city and this beats out the options there. i’d consider driving up for this food tysm &lt;3”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“La Piñata has been my favorite taco truck in Vallejo for years. Even after moving away, I still compare every taco spot to this one.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Henry D. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“This is by far the best burrito place in Vallejo hands down. In every bite of my steak and shrimp burrito you can taste the freshness of all the ingredients. He always gives me a free drink when I come. I can appreciate that level of consistent exceptional customer service. Highly Recommended La Piñata !!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“I came here after hearing such great things about La Pinata&#39;s suadero burritos, and they did not disappoint at all! This is a food truck with incredibly kind, hardworking staff…”</blockquote><figcaption>— Lynn N. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“La Piñata is so good. I come from San Francisco for it and always get it when I’m in the area. The owner and staff have amazing customer service and the food is always good and fresh. I don’t usually leave reviews but it’s worth it. My go to is the chicken and shrimp burrito and the steak and shrimp nachos. Chefs kiss!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Monster sized burritos, satisfying eats, actual REAL avocado slices instead of weird guacamole, lots and lots of outdoor seating, plus, ...wait for it.....access to an INDOOR restroom…”</blockquote><figcaption>— Echosaisis A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Easily the best Taqueria in Vallejo NGL 🔥 2 Super Steak Burritos w/everything 2 Tacos-1 asada, 1 carnitas Didn&#39;t have to ask for extra sauce , customer service was A+ . 50 min drive was 100% worth it, will def be back”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I got their lengua, cabeza and carnitas tacos. The most was so tender and flavorful. I don&#39;t feel like many do their lengua well, but theirs are definitely one of my favorites. Their salsas are both really good and have a lot of flavor.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I really like to this place. I mean it&#39;s just a taco trailer but the food was good and hardy. The service was quick. And the guy running the thing was pretty nice.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Preguntas frecuentes</p><h2>Tus preguntas, respondidas</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>¿Puedo llamar y pedir por adelantado?</summary><p>¡Sí! Llámanos al (707) 334-8381 para pedir por adelantado y no hacer fila.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuál es el horario?</summary><p>Abrimos de lunes a viernes, de 11 AM a 9 PM. Cerramos sábado y domingo.</p></details><details><summary>¿Aceptan tarjetas?</summary><p>Sí, aceptamos efectivo y tarjetas. Puede aplicarse un pequeño cargo al pagar con tarjeta.</p></details><details><summary>¿Qué me recomiendan?</summary><p>Prueba el súper burrito de suadero, el que destacó el San Francisco Chronicle. Los burritos de al pastor, lengua, carnitas y camarón también son de los favoritos.</p></details><details><summary>¿Hacen catering?</summary><p>Sí, hacemos catering. Llama a la lonchera para preguntar.</p></details><details><summary>¿Hay dónde sentarse y estacionarse?</summary><p>Tenemos mesas de picnic al aire libre, y el estacionamiento es casi todo en la calle.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuándo hay más gente?</summary><p>Los viernes a eso de las 6 PM es cuando hay más gente; la espera puede ser de hasta unos 15 minutos.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Visítanos</p>\n      <h2>Horario y ubicación</h2>\n      <address>809 Broadway<br>Vallejo, CA 94590</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\">(707) 334-8381</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>Lunes</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>Martes</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>Miércoles</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>Jueves</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>Viernes</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>Sábado</td><td>Cerrado</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>Domingo</td><td>Cerrado</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">Cerrado los fines de semana. Efectivo o tarjeta (puede aplicarse un pequeño cargo al pagar con tarjeta). Hacemos catering; llámanos para preguntar.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/640168939444142\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2H8v4h2v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V8z\"/></svg><span>Facebook</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Yelp</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google reviews</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.